{"id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-pcp-coding.md","title":"Post Correspondence Problem","display":"df-post-correspondence-problem — Post Correspondence Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","aliases":["73-df-binary-pcp-coding","73-df-post-correspondence-problem"],"display":"df-post-correspondence-problem — Post Correspondence Problem","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-pcp-coding</span><span>73-df-post-correspondence-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-post-correspondence-problem — Post Correspondence Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (binary alphabet; word operations are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> (fixed effective binary pairing code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (candidate finite tile sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_k),\\mathbf v=(v_1,\\ldots,v_k)\">\\(\\mathbf u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_k),\\mathbf v=(v_1,\\ldots,v_k)\\)</span> (presentation data)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TilePresentation}(I,k,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\in(\\mathbf 2^+)^k\\land\nI=((u_1,v_1),\\ldots,(u_k,v_k))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TilePresentation}(I,k,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\in(\\mathbf 2^+)^k\\land\nI=((u_1,v_1),\\ldots,(u_k,v_k))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PCPInst}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\;\n\\operatorname{TilePresentation}(I,k,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PCPInst}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\;\n\\operatorname{TilePresentation}(I,k,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Solvable}_{\\mathsf{PCP}}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TilePresentation}(I,k,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists i_1,\\ldots,i_m\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\nu_{i_1}\\cdots u_{i_m}=v_{i_1}\\cdots v_{i_m}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Solvable}_{\\mathsf{PCP}}(I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TilePresentation}(I,k,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists i_1,\\ldots,i_m\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\nu_{i_1}\\cdots u_{i_m}=v_{i_1}\\cdots v_{i_m}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}:\n(\\mathbf 2^+\\times\\mathbf 2^+)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf 2^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}:\n(\\mathbf 2^+\\times\\mathbf 2^+)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf 2^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq 0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}((u,v)::J)\\coloneqq\n1\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle_{\\mathcal E},\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(J)\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\n\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbf 2^+,\\;J\\in(\\mathbf 2^+\\times\\mathbf 2^+)^{&lt;\\omega})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq 0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}((u,v)::J)\\coloneqq\n1\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle_{\\mathcal E},\n\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(J)\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\n\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbf 2^+,\\;J\\in(\\mathbf 2^+\\times\\mathbf 2^+)^{&lt;\\omega})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PCP}_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I):\n\\operatorname{Solvable}_{\\mathsf{PCP}}(I)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}correspondence\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PCP}_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I):\n\\operatorname{Solvable}_{\\mathsf{PCP}}(I)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TilePresentation}\">\\(\\operatorname{TilePresentation}\\)</span> rebinds the length and both word vectors for every candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPInst}\">\\(\\operatorname{PCPInst}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Solvable}_{\\mathsf{PCP}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Solvable}_{\\mathsf{PCP}}\\)</span> do not depend on ambient tile variables.</li>\n<li>Recursion decreases the finite list length, so the instance code is well defined. Prefix tags distinguish the empty list from a cons cell.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}$ (binary alphabet; word operations are from [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ and $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$ (fixed effective binary pairing code, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}","displ